{
 "duration": 26.028,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Every January, Ben promised to hike more.",
   "start": 0.4,
   "end": 2.883
  },
  {
   "text": "By March, his boots were back in the closet.",
   "start": 3.033,
   "end": 5.436
  },
  {
   "text": "This year he tried something else.",
   "start": 5.636,
   "end": 7.471
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix.",
   "start": 7.671,
   "end": 8.598
  },
  {
   "text": "On New Year's Day, many state parks run guided First Day Hikes, often free.",
   "start": 8.798,
   "end": 13.586
  },
  {
   "text": "Check your state parks website, sign up, and go.",
   "start": 13.786,
   "end": 16.557
  },
  {
   "text": "Then pick one new park every month, and log each visit with a stamp or sticker.",
   "start": 16.757,
   "end": 21.346
  },
  {
   "text": "By spring, Ben had four parks on his map.",
   "start": 21.546,
   "end": 23.93
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for New Year's Day.",
   "start": 24.33,
   "end": 25.828
  }
 ],
